+/* SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1 */
+/*
+ *
+ *   Definitions for various global variables and structures
+ *
+ *   Copyright (C) International Business Machines  Corp., 2002, 2011
+ *                 Etersoft, 2012
